          [OF hNcut_open hQ1_Ncut hS1_Ncut hZ_sub hZ_conn hQ1_cl hS1_cl])
  qed
  show ?thesis
    using hD44_frontier_sphere_book_step hD44_same_component_book_step
    by (intro conjI)
